# Structuring cleanup-pipeline regression guard.
#
# Fails if any patchir-decomp fixture emits more `goto` statements than its
# recorded budget in goto-budget.txt.  Pins the structuring KPI so the cleanup
# redesign (docs/structuring_cleanup_redesign.md) cannot silently regress.
#
# RUN: bash %S/check-goto-budget.sh %patchir-decomp %strip-json-comments %S
